* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_tradeoff (20 Nov 2026): two-phase tradeoff analysis (stages.stc L49-84,
* solve.stc), as Example 1c of the TIMES stochastics user note: three tradeoff points (SW_SUBS). Phase 1
* minimises a composite objective, the system cost (OBJZ) plus a weight of 0.05, 0.2 or 1.0 on UCEXT, REG1's
* transport CO2 over all periods (S_UCOBJ); phase 2 minimises cost and keeps the phase-1 optimum of that
* composite objective (UC_RHS OBJ1 'N' EPS).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET UC_N /
UCEXT 'REG1 transport CO2, all periods'
/;
SET UC_R_SUM /
REG1.UCEXT
/;
SET UC_T_SUM /
REG1.UCEXT.2005
REG1.UCEXT.2010
REG1.UCEXT.2015
REG1.UCEXT.2020
REG1.UCEXT.2030
REG1.UCEXT.2050
/;
PARAMETER UC_COMNET /
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2005.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2010.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2015.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2020.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2030.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
UCEXT.LHS.REG1.2050.TRACO2.ANNUAL 1
/;
PARAMETER SW_SUBS /
1.1 3
/;
PARAMETER S_UCOBJ /
OBJZ.1 1
UCEXT.1 0.05
OBJZ.2 1
UCEXT.2 0.2
OBJZ.3 1
UCEXT.3 1
/;
PARAMETER UC_RHS /
OBJ1.N EPS
/;
